=== factory checkpoint
Snapshot and restore the worktree around an agent session

Usage:
  factory checkpoint [command]

Available Commands:
  diff        List the paths that differ between run N and the worktree now
  drop        Delete a session's snapshots
  reap        Delete snapshots and scratch dirs left by sessions that never ended
  restore     Put the worktree back as run N saved it
  save        Snapshot tracked, staged and untracked files as run N

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for checkpoint

Use "factory checkpoint [command] --help" for more information about a command.

=== factory checkpoint diff
List the paths that differ between run N and the worktree now

Usage:
  factory checkpoint diff <session> <run> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for diff

=== factory checkpoint drop
Delete a session's snapshots

Usage:
  factory checkpoint drop <session> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for drop

=== factory checkpoint reap
Delete snapshots and scratch dirs left by sessions that never ended

Usage:
  factory checkpoint reap [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for reap

=== factory checkpoint restore
Put the worktree back as run N saved it

Usage:
  factory checkpoint restore <session> <run> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for restore

=== factory checkpoint save
Snapshot tracked, staged and untracked files as run N

Usage:
  factory checkpoint save <session> <run> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for save

