=== factory design
Make design edits to a JSX tree without a coding agent

Usage:
  factory design [command]

Available Commands:
  edit        Apply edit requests (a JSON list of requests) to a file and print the diff without writing it
  stamp       Give every JSX element under dir one unique oid
  tweak       Apply a design delta (a file under dir) to the tree; fail when the edit needs an agent

Flags:
  -h, --help          help for design
      --jail          run the pack under the sandbox with no network and only the tree writable
      --pack string   directory of the design pack (default "packs/design")

Use "factory design [command] --help" for more information about a command.

=== factory design edit
Apply edit requests (a JSON list of requests) to a file and print the diff without writing it

Usage:
  factory design edit <dir> <file> <requests.json> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help        help for edit
      --strip-ids   leave no data-oid or move key in the result

Global Flags:
      --jail          run the pack under the sandbox with no network and only the tree writable
      --pack string   directory of the design pack (default "packs/design")

=== factory design stamp
Give every JSX element under dir one unique oid

Usage:
  factory design stamp <dir> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for stamp

Global Flags:
      --jail          run the pack under the sandbox with no network and only the tree writable
      --pack string   directory of the design pack (default "packs/design")

=== factory design tweak
Apply a design delta (a file under dir) to the tree; fail when the edit needs an agent

Usage:
  factory design tweak <dir> <delta> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for tweak

Global Flags:
      --jail          run the pack under the sandbox with no network and only the tree writable
      --pack string   directory of the design pack (default "packs/design")

