Check an action against a policy rules file (enterprise)

Usage:
  factory policy <action> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help           help for policy
      --repo string    repository the action touches
      --role string    actor role
      --rules string   path to the YAML rules file
      --usd float      spend the action would add

