=== factory repomap
Print a ranked, token-budgeted symbol map of the repository for a context pack

Usage:
  factory repomap [flags]

Flags:
      --budget int      token budget of the map (default 1024)
  -h, --help            help for repomap
      --root string     repository root (default ".")
      --ticket string   ticket text; files and identifiers it names seed the ranking

=== factory report
Show tokens per merged PR, rework, human touches and cycle time (operator only)

Usage:
  factory report [flags]

Flags:
      --budget         print spend against each budget in .factory/budgets.yaml
      --by string      group rows by team, workflow or pack (default "team")
      --churn string   with --cost, a revert within this long after merge counts against the PR (default "14d")
      --cost           print cost per surviving merged PR, per repo and in total
  -h, --help           help for report
      --json           write JSON instead of markdown
      --out string     write the report to this file; never under .github/ or a PR body file
      --since string   window length ending now, such as 7d or 36h (default "7d")

