=== factory smoke
Opens an issue in the sandbox repository, runs it through the real loop and merge queue with a fake agent
and reads the result back. Set FACTORY_SMOKE_REPO=owner/name and GITHUB_TOKEN. Use a repository you do not mind writing to.

Usage:
  factory smoke [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help               help for smoke
      --shadow             shadow run: nothing is dispatched or merged
      --timeout duration   how long to wait for the work to land (default 5m0s)

